OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal dump clear-up expected to
OL,4,Acost #240k
OL,5,
OL,6,FHilton said the council had written to
OL,7,Fthe prime minister and urged the
OL,8,Fgovernment to provide financial support
OL,9,Fto complete the clearance. The Cabinet
OL,10,FOffice has been asked for comment.
